.Dd May 29, 2026
.Dt ZDOTS-AI-STACK 7
.Os zdots
.Sh NAME
.Nm zdots-ai-stack
.Nd local AI services and prompt routing in zdots
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The AI stack centers on llama.cpp for chat, a dedicated embedding server for
RAG, guarded one-shot inference through
.Xr ai-query 1 ,
and domain-aware routing through
.Xr zdots-ask 1 .
.Sh DEFAULT ENDPOINTS
.Bl -tag -width "Embedding"
.It Chat
.Li http://127.0.0.1:11500
.It Embedding
.Li http://127.0.0.1:11501
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width ZDOTS_AI_MODELS_DIR
.It Ev ZDOTS_AI_MODE
`local`, `cloud`, or `none`.
.It Ev ZDOTS_AI_ENDPOINT
Chat endpoint.
.It Ev ZDOTS_AI_EMBED_ENDPOINT
Embedding endpoint.
.It Ev ZDOTS_AI_PROFILE
Model profile.
.It Ev ZDOTS_AI_MODELS_DIR
Model storage root.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr llama-ctl 8 ,
.Xr ai-query 1 ,
.Xr zdots-ask 1
